he passive component is owned by\n84\t  a different team (RHOAI Pipelines) than the nearest active epic's team, its\n85\t  validation is a separate Implementation epic (E002) per the Step 2 exception.\n86\t- **Redundant HLR wording**: HLR-1 and HLR-3 describe one capability (the\n87\t  comparison surface) in two presentation modes; consolidated into E001 at P0\n88\t  rather than split by priority label (see traceability matrix).\n89\t- **E002 priority note**: E002 confirms a P0 capability's data foundation but\n90\t  carries no blocking edge, so priority inheritance does not raise it; it is\n91\t  P1. Risk is low (per-run data is already displayed). If E002 finds gaps,\n92\t  follow-up Data Science Pipelines work will need its own epic — this is a\n93\t  coordination risk, not a dependency.\n94\t- **Out-of-scope consistency**: \"comparison across clusters or across projects\"\n95\t  is out of scope; no epic's scope crosses project or cluster boundaries.\n96\t\n97\t## Tiered Delivery\n98\t\n99\tNot applicable — the strategy has no external dependencies with uncertain\n100\ttiming; all work is in-platform.\n101\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9e6d109824de687a","agent_id":"a0858aeebe10c8adb","session_id":"56ee33b5-80f9-4b38-b563-1eee8ceebc36","uuid":"011e3c10-410b-4feb-aae7-d82645ee4a91","timestamp":"2026-10-26T16:19:50.887Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-97ef494b4692e7c9","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
